<title>DENMARK: Copenhagen stock exchange cannot update prices.</title>
<headline>Copenhagen stock exchange cannot update prices.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Copenhagen Stock exchange said on Tuesday that due to technical problems it is unable to update bid prices, last prices and other data for Danish shares.</p>
<p>It said it was impossible to say when the systems would be functioning normally again.</p>
<p>--Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
